# glib 0.18.5 — GHSA-wrw7-89jp-8q8g (Iterator/DoubleEndedIterator unsoundness
# in glib::VariantStrIter; fixed in 0.20.0).
#
# Transitive via wry → webkit2gtk → gtk → glib, which is Linux/macOS-only.
# Verified absent from the x86_64-pc-windows-msvc target via:
#   cargo tree --target x86_64-pc-windows-msvc -i glib  → "nothing to print"
# README locks the ship target to Windows (WebView2, not webkit2gtk), so this
# code path is never compiled into the released binary.
#
# Re-evaluate if cross-platform ship is ever planned: revisit upstream
# Tauri/gtk bumps to a glib >= 0.20.0 chain before removing this entry.
